{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Perhaps I shall be built up from her.</b> This teaches about one who has no children — that he is not 'built' but ruined." "<b>I shall be built up from her.</b> By the merit that I bring my rival into my house." "<b>To the voice of Sarai.</b> To the holy spirit that was in her (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:52.723464379Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}